# Package Catalogue
error-agi-commit-invalid = That version marker isn't valid. It must be exactly 40 lowercase letters or numbers.
error-agi-folder-invalid = That folder isn't valid. Choose a new folder inside ordin's own storage area.
error-agi-name-invalid = The name must be between 1 and 120 characters.
error-agi-package-name-invalid = The package name must be 1 to 214 characters, using lowercase letters, numbers, dots, hyphens or underscores.
error-agi-package-version-invalid = The package version must be between 1 and 64 characters.
error-agi-repository-mismatch = Give both the version marker and its source, or leave both empty.
error-agi-state-inconsistent = This agent is marked as refused, but no failed check or stop reason backs that up. Try adding it again.
error-pkg-agent-name-ambiguous = Two agents in this workspace share the same name. Rename one of them.
error-pkg-agent-not-offered = That agent isn't available to add. It may have failed its checks or been withdrawn.
error-pkg-agent-unknown = ordin can't find that agent.
error-pkg-already-added = That agent is already in this workspace.
error-pkg-bundled-agent-fixed = The agent that comes with ordin can't be removed or changed.
error-pkg-bundled-agent-missing = The agent that comes with ordin couldn't be found. Reinstall ordin or tell IT.
error-pkg-bundled-agent-refused = The agent that comes with ordin can't be used because it didn't pass its checks or needs approval.
error-pkg-check-unavailable = ordin couldn't run its checks on that agent. Try again in a moment.
error-pkg-choice-not-allowed = That choice isn't one this agent allows. Pick one of the offered choices.
error-pkg-deprecated-as-agent = That item is out of date and can't be added as an agent.
error-pkg-folder-mismatch = This agent's folder has changed since it was set up. Repair it to put it right.
error-pkg-folder-unusable = This agent's folder can't be checked or rebuilt. Remove the agent and add it again.
error-pkg-install-failed = ordin couldn't set up that agent, even after trying twice. Try again later.
error-pkg-instance-not-ready = That agent isn't ready yet. Wait a moment and try again.
error-pkg-instance-unknown = ordin can't find that agent in this workspace. It may have been removed.
error-pkg-library-unavailable = The catalogue couldn't be searched. Try again in a moment.
error-pkg-needs-it-approval = This agent needs approval from IT before you can use it.
error-pkg-need-invalid = Describe what you need in between 1 and 500 characters.
error-pkg-not-an-agent = That item isn't an agent, so it can't be added here.
error-pkg-no-update = There is no update waiting for that agent.
error-pkg-pack-missing = This workspace can't provide something the agent needs, so it can't be set up.
error-pkg-store-failed = ordin couldn't read the choices saved for that agent. Choose again.
error-pkg-trial-needs-trust = A trial of this agent needs approval from IT first.
error-pkg-trial-not-nameable = A trial of your own draft can't be started by name. Start it from your draft instead.
error-pkg-trial-no-scope = A trial of your own draft can't be checked this way. Check your draft from the draft page.
error-pkg-unsafe = This agent failed its safety checks and can't be used.
